{"seq":1,"slug":"party-invite-system","title":"组队与邀请系统：Party、邀请码与跨平台支持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/features/party-invite-system","wordCount":1215,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"组队与邀请系统-party-邀请码与跨平台支持\">组队与邀请系统：Party、邀请码与跨平台支持</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Party</strong></td>\n<td>玩家在游戏前组成的临时社交单元，跨大厅持久存在（与 Room 的区别）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>邀请码（Join Code）</strong></td>\n<td>6 位短期字母数字码，适合语音中口头告知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>邀请链接（Invite Link）</strong></td>\n<td>带 Token 的深度链接，适合通过聊天工具分享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>预留位</strong></td>\n<td>发送邀请时为被邀请者占位，有 TTL，防止满员竞态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>UPA（Unified Platform Account）</strong></td>\n<td>统一平台账号，将 Steam/Xbox/PSN 等多平台账号绑定到同一游戏身份</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Party Affinity</strong></td>\n<td>同 Party 成员路由到同一 Lobby 节点，减少跨节点通信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"party-的概念与价值\">Party 的概念与价值</h2><p>Party（组队/小队）是玩家在游戏前形成的临时社交单元：几个好友组成一个 Party，一起进入大厅、一起匹配对局、一起分到同一队伍。Party 系统的核心价值是<strong>保持好友组的完整性</strong>——无论经历多少次匹配、等待、重新匹配，Party 内的玩家始终在一起。</p>\n<p>Party 与 Room 的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Party 是玩家间的社交绑定关系（跨大厅持久存在）</li>\n<li>Room 是特定大厅内的游戏准备容器（一次对局对应一个 Room）</li>\n<li>一个 Party 可以一起进入同一个 Room；Room 可以没有 Party（随机玩家组成）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"party-数据模型\">Party 数据模型</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type Party struct {&#10;    PartyID    string         // UUID&#10;    LeaderID   string         // Party 领袖（可转让）&#10;    Members    []PartyMember  // 成员列表（包括 Leader）&#10;    InviteCode string         // 6 位邀请码（短期有效）&#10;    InviteLink string         // 分享链接（长期有效，含 Token）&#10;    CreatedAt  time.Time&#10;    MaxSize    int            // 最大人数（通常 = 游戏的最大队伍大小）&#10;    Platform   string         // 跨平台标识&#10;}&#10;&#10;type PartyMember struct {&#10;    PlayerID    string&#10;    Nickname    string&#10;    Platform    string        // PC/Console/Mobile&#10;    JoinedAt    time.Time&#10;    IsLeader    bool&#10;    IsOnline    bool&#10;    PresenceStatus PresenceStatus // InLobby / InGame / AFK&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Party</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PartyID    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // UUID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    LeaderID   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // Party 领袖（可转让）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Members    []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PartyMember</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 成员列表（包括 Leader）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    InviteCode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 6 位邀请码（短期有效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    InviteLink </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 分享链接（长期有效，含 Token）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CreatedAt  </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MaxSize    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 最大人数（通常 = 游戏的最大队伍大小）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Platform   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 跨平台标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PartyMember</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PlayerID    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Nickname    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Platform    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // PC/Console/Mobile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    JoinedAt    </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    IsLeader    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    IsOnline    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PresenceStatus </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PresenceStatus</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // InLobby / InGame / AFK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"邀请机制的三种方式\">邀请机制的三种方式</h2><h3 id=\"方式一-邀请码-join-code\">方式一：邀请码（Join Code）</h3><p>生成一个短期有效的 6 位字母数字码，适合语音中口头告知好友：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"const JoinCodeLength = 6&#10;const JoinCodeChars = &quot;ABCDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVWXYZ23456789&quot; // 排除易混淆字符 0/O/I/1&#10;&#10;func generateJoinCode() string {&#10;    code := make([]byte, JoinCodeLength)&#10;    for i := range code {&#10;        code[i] = JoinCodeChars[rand.Intn(len(JoinCodeChars))]&#10;    }&#10;    return string(code)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 存储：code → partyID，TTL 10 分钟&#10;redis.SetEx(&quot;party:code:&quot;+code, 10*time.Minute, partyID)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JoinCodeLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JoinCodeChars</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ABCDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVWXYZ23456789\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 排除易混淆字符 0/O/I/1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateJoinCode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, JoinCodeLength)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> code {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        code[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> JoinCodeChars[rand.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Intn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(JoinCodeChars))]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 存储：code → partyID，TTL 10 分钟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetEx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"party:code:\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">code, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Minute, partyID)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>加入流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>玩家输入 6 位码</li>\n<li>服务端查找 <code>party:code:{code}</code> → 获取 partyID</li>\n<li>验证 Party 未满、玩家未在其他 Party 中</li>\n<li>将玩家加入 Party，通知所有成员</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"方式二-邀请链接-invite-link\">方式二：邀请链接（Invite Link）</h3><p>生成带 Token 的深度链接，适合通过聊天工具分享：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"https://game.example.com/join?party=&lt;party_id&gt;&amp;token=&lt;invite_token&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>https://game.example.com/join?party=&#x3C;party_id>&#x26;token=&#x3C;invite_token></span></span></code></pre></div><p>Invite Token 的特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>绑定到特定 PartyID</li>\n<li>有效期较长（30 分钟）</li>\n<li>单次使用（可配置为多次使用）</li>\n<li>携带发起邀请的玩家信息（用于显示&quot;某某邀请你加入&quot;）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type InviteToken struct {&#10;    Token     string&#10;    PartyID   string&#10;    InviterID string&#10;    CreatedAt time.Time&#10;    ExpiresAt time.Time&#10;    MaxUses   int        // -1 = 无限次&#10;    UsedCount int&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InviteToken</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Token     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PartyID   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    InviterID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CreatedAt </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ExpiresAt </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MaxUses   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // -1 = 无限次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    UsedCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>移动端/主机端通过 Universal Link / Deep Link 直接唤起游戏并完成加入流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方式三-好友列表直接邀请-direct-invite\">方式三：好友列表直接邀请（Direct Invite）</h3><p>通过游戏内好友系统发送邀请通知：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type FriendInvite struct {&#10;    InviteID    string&#10;    FromPlayer  string&#10;    ToPlayer    string    // 被邀请的好友 PlayerID&#10;    PartyID     string&#10;    RoomID      string    // 可选，直接邀请到特定房间&#10;    ExpiresAt   time.Time // 通常 2 分钟&#10;    Message     string    // 可选的自定义消息&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FriendInvite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    InviteID    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    FromPlayer  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ToPlayer    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 被邀请的好友 PlayerID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PartyID     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RoomID      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 可选，直接邀请到特定房间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ExpiresAt   </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 通常 2 分钟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Message     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 可选的自定义消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>好友邀请通过推送通知（或大厅内 Toast 提示）送达被邀请方，被邀请方点击&quot;接受&quot;完成加入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"party-操作详解\">Party 操作详解</h2><h3 id=\"转让领袖\">转让领袖</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (ps *PartyService) transferLeadership(partyID, currentLeaderID, newLeaderID string) error {&#10;    party, err := ps.store.GetParty(partyID)&#10;    if err != nil { return err }&#10;&#10;    if party.LeaderID != currentLeaderID {&#10;        return ErrNotPartyLeader&#10;    }&#10;    if !party.hasMember(newLeaderID) {&#10;        return ErrPlayerNotInParty&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    party.LeaderID = newLeaderID&#10;    ps.store.UpdateParty(party)&#10;    ps.broadcast(party, LeaderChangedEvent{NewLeaderID: newLeaderID})&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PartyService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transferLeadership</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">partyID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">currentLeaderID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newLeaderID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    party, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ps.store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetParty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(partyID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> party.LeaderID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentLeaderID {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ErrNotPartyLeader</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">party.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasMember</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newLeaderID) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ErrPlayerNotInParty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    party.LeaderID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newLeaderID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ps.store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UpdateParty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(party)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">broadcast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(party, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LeaderChangedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{NewLeaderID: newLeaderID})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"踢出成员\">踢出成员</h3><p>只有 Leader 可以踢出成员。踢出后被踢玩家收到通知，其预留的 Room Slot 立即释放。</p>\n<h3 id=\"party-解散\">Party 解散</h3><p>Leader 离开时，可以选择&quot;解散 Party&quot;或&quot;转让领袖&quot;。自动解散条件：最后一名成员离开，或 Party 处于空闲超时（通常 10 分钟无活动）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨平台-party-的挑战\">跨平台 Party 的挑战</h2><p>现代游戏越来越多地支持跨平台联机（PC + Console + Mobile），Party 系统需要处理以下差异：</p>\n<h3 id=\"平台标识与账号绑定\">平台标识与账号绑定</h3><p>不同平台（Steam/Xbox/PSN/iOS/Android）有各自的账号体系。Party 系统需要一个**统一平台账号（Unified Platform Account, UPA）**层，将各平台账号绑定到同一个游戏账号：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"PlayerID (游戏内唯一) ←→ SteamID (PC)&#10;                     ←→ GamerTag (Xbox)&#10;                     ←→ PSN ID (PlayStation)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>PlayerID (游戏内唯一) ←→ SteamID (PC)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                     ←→ GamerTag (Xbox)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                     ←→ PSN ID (PlayStation)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>好友列表同步：当玩家用 Steam 账号登录，其 Steam 好友中也在玩本游戏的人应该出现在游戏好友列表中。这需要定期同步各平台的好友关系到游戏好友系统。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨平台匹配限制\">跨平台匹配限制</h3><p>某些平台要求（或玩家设置）只与同平台玩家匹配（如主机玩家不愿与使用键鼠的 PC 玩家同组）。Party 系统需要记录每个成员的平台，匹配时作为约束条件传递给 Matchmaker：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;party_id&quot;: &quot;party-123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;members&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;player_id&quot;: &quot;p1&quot;, &quot;platform&quot;: &quot;pc&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;player_id&quot;: &quot;p2&quot;, &quot;platform&quot;: &quot;xbox&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;cross_platform_allowed&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;preferred_platform&quot;: &quot;mixed&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"party_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"party-123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"members\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"player_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"platform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"player_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"platform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"xbox\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cross_platform_allowed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"preferred_platform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mixed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"主机平台的-party-系统集成\">主机平台的 Party 系统集成</h3><p>PlayStation 和 Xbox 有原生的系统级 Party 功能（语音聊天、活动邀请）。理想情况下，游戏的 Party 系统应该与主机 Party 同步，这需要调用平台 SDK：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Xbox Live Multiplayer</strong>: <code>XblMultiplayerManager</code> 管理 Session + Party</li>\n<li><strong>PlayStation Network</strong>: <code>sceNpMatchingSetRoomMemberDataInternal</code> 同步房间状态</li>\n<li><strong>Nintendo Switch</strong>: Local Play / Online Play API</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实践上，中小团队通常只在主机平台上支持系统级语音（调用平台 API），游戏内 Party 逻辑用自己的服务维护，两套系统并行运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"party-邀请流程图\">Party 邀请流程图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Leader as Party Leader&#10;    participant Server as Party Service&#10;    participant Redis as Redis&#10;    participant Friend as 被邀请好友&#10;&#10;    Leader-&gt;&gt;Server: 发送邀请 (inviteeID)&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 预留 Room Slot (TTL 2min)&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Redis: SETEX invite:{token} 2min InviteToken&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Leader: 邀请链接 / invite token&#10;&#10;    Leader-&gt;&gt;Friend: 分享邀请链接(游戏内通知/聊天)&#10;    Friend-&gt;&gt;Server: 点击接受 (token)&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Redis: GET invite:{token} → 验证&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 释放预留位 → 正式加入房间&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Friend: 加入成功,房间状态快照&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Leader: 广播:好友已加入\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Leader as Party Leader\n    participant Server as Party Service\n    participant Redis as Redis\n    participant Friend as 被邀请好友\n\n    Leader-&gt;&gt;Server: 发送邀请 (inviteeID)\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 预留 Room Slot (TTL 2min)\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Redis: SETEX invite:{token} 2min InviteToken\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Leader: 邀请链接 / invite token\n\n    Leader-&gt;&gt;Friend: 分享邀请链接(游戏内通知/聊天)\n    Friend-&gt;&gt;Server: 点击接受 (token)\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Redis: GET invite:{token} → 验证\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 释放预留位 → 正式加入房间\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Friend: 加入成功,房间状态快照\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Leader: 广播:好友已加入</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Party 系统是大厅社交功能的核心，其关键设计决策有三个：一是 Party 与 Room 解耦（Party 跨大厅持久，Room 是单次对局容器）；二是三种邀请方式覆盖不同场景（邀请码适合语音、链接适合聊天工具、直接邀请适合好友列表）；三是预留位机制解决并发加入的竞态，确保邀请有效的玩家不会遇到&quot;满员&quot;错误。跨平台 Party 需要 UPA 层统一账号体系，并在匹配约束中携带平台信息。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"组队与邀请系统：Party、邀请码与跨平台支持","id":"组队与邀请系统-party-邀请码与跨平台支持"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Party 的概念与价值","id":"party-的概念与价值"},{"level":2,"text":"Party 数据模型","id":"party-数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"邀请机制的三种方式","id":"邀请机制的三种方式"},{"level":3,"text":"方式一：邀请码（Join Code）","id":"方式一-邀请码-join-code"},{"level":3,"text":"方式二：邀请链接（Invite Link）","id":"方式二-邀请链接-invite-link"},{"level":3,"text":"方式三：好友列表直接邀请（Direct Invite）","id":"方式三-好友列表直接邀请-direct-invite"},{"level":2,"text":"Party 操作详解","id":"party-操作详解"},{"level":3,"text":"转让领袖","id":"转让领袖"},{"level":3,"text":"踢出成员","id":"踢出成员"},{"level":3,"text":"Party 解散","id":"party-解散"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台 Party 的挑战","id":"跨平台-party-的挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"平台标识与账号绑定","id":"平台标识与账号绑定"},{"level":3,"text":"跨平台匹配限制","id":"跨平台匹配限制"},{"level":3,"text":"主机平台的 Party 系统集成","id":"主机平台的-party-系统集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Party 邀请流程图","id":"party-邀请流程图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"房间生命周期：FSM 状态机、玩家容量与属性管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/architecture/room-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"准备确认与倒计时：Ready Check、地图投票与同步倒计时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/features/ready-check-countdown"}}